  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "- Added inbound middleware for permission checks, rate limiting, concurrency gates, and timeout enforcement.\n- Introduced reusable throttling primitives including TokenBucketLimiter, PolicyRateLimiter, and ConcurrencyGate.\n- Added configurable token-bucket options to simplify traffic-shaping setup.\n- Included TimeSynchronizer for clock coordination in distributed networking scenarios.\n- Improved modularity so pipeline and throttling features can be consumed independently from the broader transport runtime.\n- General cleanup, packaging polish, and documentation improvements.",
